title: Self-Deleting Executable
id: 17fb118d-abc4-42b2-bea7-f7f6adbc4d9b
status: experimental
description: Detects a process deleting its own on-disk image, a common anti-forensic self-cleanup step used by droppers and loaders after execution.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1070/004/
logsource:
  category: file_delete
  product: windows
detection:
  selection:
    TargetFilename|fieldref: Image
  condition: selection
fields:
  - Image
  - TargetFilename
  - User
falsepositives:
  - Installers and updaters that remove their own temporary bootstrapper after setup
level: high
tags:
  - attack.defense_evasion
  - attack.t1070.004
